# The crutch pit (`game::crutches`) in level 1, for `scripts/record-run --capture` (format:
# src/capture/timeline.rs). Start just before the gap past the robot pit, its WET FLOOR sign at the bottom:
#   NATHAN_START=102 scripts/record-run --capture crutch-pit.mp4 scripts/tours/crutch-pit.timeline 1
# Walk in: CRACK! Han's plunger comes down, SCHLORP, up onto the ledge; St. Plunger's Hospital;
# then Nat hobbles, tries to toot (nothing), tries to hop the gap on crutches, and doesn't make
# it: in again, and out again. ~26 s.

# The level's intro line; a look at the sign.
wait 2.5

# In.
hold Right 0.6

# CRACK, the plunger, the haul, the hospital.
wait 8.0

# Hobbling about.
hold Left 0.8
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.5
wait 0.3

# Up... and a toot that doesn't come.
hold Space 250ms
wait 0.1
tap Space
wait 0.8

# Try to hop the gap (too small a hop: in again).
hold Right 0.4
hold Right Space 0.5
hold Right 0.3
wait 8.5
